---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SectionRule from '../components/SectionRule.astro';
import Callout from '../components/Callout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="Shefa — Hebrew for abundance. A name with intention and a business built around it.">

  <div class="page-inner">
    <section class="section">
      <div class="page-header">
        <p class="label gold">ABOUT SHEFA</p>
        <div class="header-rule"></div>
        <p class="page-subtitle">A name with intention. A business built around it.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="meaning-block">
        <p class="hebrew-large" lang="he" dir="rtl">שפע</p>
        <p class="meaning-text">
          Shefa (שפע) — Hebrew for <em>abundance</em>, <em>flow</em>, <em>plenty</em>, or <em>bounty</em>. The image is one of overflow: goodness, blessings, and sustenance that cannot be contained. Beyond material wealth, Shefa describes the spiritual flow of Divine beneficence — energy and light — moving into the world.
        </p>
        <p class="meaning-text">
          The ancient teaching is that Shefa can be cultivated. A giving mindset and a heart of servitude open the channel. Imagine a brilliant beam from a spotlight, reaching toward a performer on stage — that is the flow of God's beneficence in every form. This is Actionable Abundance: the belief that how we orient ourselves determines whether that flow reaches us.
        </p>
        <div class="scripture-block">
          <blockquote class="scripture-quote">
            <p>"Be anxious about nothing, but in everything by prayer and supplication, with thanksgiving, let your requests be made known to God."</p>
            <cite>Philippians 4:6</cite>
          </blockquote>
          <blockquote class="scripture-quote">
            <p>"For God has not given us a spirit of fear, but of power and of love and of a sound mind."</p>
            <cite>2 Timothy 1:7</cite>
          </blockquote>
          <blockquote class="scripture-quote">
            <p>"Finally, brethren, whatever things are true, whatever things are noble, whatever things are just, whatever things are pure, whatever things are lovely, whatever things are of good report, if there is any virtue and if there is anything praiseworthy — meditate on these things."</p>
            <cite>Philippians 4:8</cite>
          </blockquote>
        </div>
        <p class="meaning-text">Living in fear takes us out of the flow of Shefa.</p>
        <p class="meaning-text">
          The name is a declaration. Everything we build — the acquisitions, the operating systems, the partnerships — starts from this premise: that when businesses are run well and led with integrity, abundance follows. And when it does, it should go somewhere meaningful.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <SectionRule number="01" title="HOW WE OPERATE" />
      <div class="principles">
        <div class="principle">
          <h3>Conviction over ambition.</h3>
          <p>We underwrite conservatively. We scope engagements honestly. We don't negotiate on integrity. Not for a better deal, not for a better relationship, not for a better outcome.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="principle">
          <h3>Operators, more than advisors.</h3>
          <p>We've built and run businesses. That's the lens we bring to every acquisition and every engagement. We know what it costs to get something operational. We respect that cost.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="principle">
          <h3>Purpose is not a tagline.</h3>
          <p>We build businesses and fund missions. The two are not in conflict. We don't sand the mission out of our work — it's the reason the work is worth doing.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <Callout variant="navy">
        <p>We are not trying to be the largest. We are trying to be the most disciplined — and the most purposeful.</p>
      </Callout>
    </section>

    <section class="section section--sm">
      <SectionRule number="02" title="THE ENTITIES" />
      <div class="entity-list">
        <div class="entity-item">
          <h3><a href="/investment">Shefa Investment Group →</a></h3>
          <p>Real estate and small-business acquisitions. Disciplined underwriting. Long-term hold orientation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="entity-item">
          <h3><a href="/advisory">Shefa Advisory Group →</a></h3>
          <p>Fractional COO and CRO services. Operating systems that stick — built by operators, not consultants.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-header {
    margin-bottom: 64px;
  }

  .header-rule {
    width: 100%;
    height: 1.5px;
    background: var(--gold);
    margin: 12px 0 24px;
  }

  .page-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }

  .meaning-block {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .hebrew-large {
    font-family: var(--font-hebrew);
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 5rem);
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .meaning-text {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-2);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .meaning-text em {
    color: var(--text);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .scripture-block {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .scripture-quote {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--gold);
    padding: 12px 20px;
    background: var(--surface);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .scripture-quote p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-2);
    line-height: 1.75;
    font-style: italic;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }

  .scripture-quote cite {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--gold);
    font-style: normal;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .principles {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 40px;
    max-width: 680px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .principle h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .principle p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-2);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .entity-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 32px;
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .entity-item h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .entity-item h3 a {
    color: var(--text);
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .entity-item h3 a:hover {
    color: var(--gold);
  }

  .entity-item p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-2);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>
